{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveDoNotShowNotification"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"notification"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.auroraeditor\/documentation\/AuroraEditor\/INotification","preciseIdentifier":"s:12AuroraEditor13INotificationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"INotification"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The INotification object to be marked as “do not show again” and saved."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"notification"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This function appends the provided "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"INotification"},{"type":"text","text":" object to the list of notifications that should not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displayed again. It then encodes the updated list as JSON data and stores it in persistent storage using the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“doNotShowNotifications” key. This allows you to maintain a list of notifications that have been marked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for exclusion from future display."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The INotification type is assumed to conform to the Codable protocol. The INotification type should have","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same structure as the data stored under the “doNotShowNotifications” key to ensure proper","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encoding and decoding.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"See Also","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"listDoNotShowNotifications()"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"See Also","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"INotification"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"warning","name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ensure that the INotification type conforms to the Codable protocol and matches the structure of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data stored under the “doNotShowNotifications” key. Inconsistencies may lead to decoding errors.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","title":"saveDoNotShowNotification(notification:)","externalID":"s:12AuroraEditor12LocalStorageC25saveDoNotShowNotification12notificationyAA13INotificationV_tF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveDoNotShowNotification"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"notification"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12AuroraEditor13INotificationV","text":"INotification"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"modules":[{"name":"Aurora Editor"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Saves a notification as “do not show again” in persistent storage.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/auroraeditor\/localstorage\/savedonotshownotification(notification:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.auroraeditor\/documentation\/AuroraEditor","doc:\/\/com.auroraeditor\/documentation\/AuroraEditor\/LocalStorage"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.auroraeditor\/documentation\/AuroraEditor\/LocalStorage\/saveDoNotShowNotification(notification:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://c